    "netlist": "* ============================================================\n* Op-amp + analog multiplier square root extractor\n* Generated by the cent compiler\n*\n* \u00a3:  V_out = sqrt(V_in)\n* \u00a2:  scale(V_in, 1) -> div(_, 1) -> sqrt(_) -> V_out\n*     (degenerates to: V_out^2 = V_in, solved by feedback)\n* \u2206:  op-amp (U1) + analog multiplier (U2) in feedback loop\n*\n* Equilibrium: V_out^2 / 10 = V_in  ->  V_out = sqrt(10 * V_in)\n* With V_in = 5.0V: V_out = sqrt(50.0) = 7.071068V\n* ============================================================\n\nVIN 1 0 DC 5.0\nEOUT 3 0 1 2 1e6\nEMULT 4 0 VALUE = { V(3) * V(3) / 10.0 }\nR1 4 2 1k\nRg 2 0 1meg\n.OP\n.PRINT DC V(3)\n.END\n",
